1. TECH REQUIREMENTS
------------------------------------------------------------
- Static site: plain HTML, CSS and vanilla JavaScript. No frameworks, no build step, no backend.
- ALL file processing happens in the user's browser. Files are never uploaded to any server. Say this clearly on every tool page in one short line: "Your file never leaves your phone or computer."
- Libraries only from cdnjs.cloudflare.com, with pinned versions:
  - pdf.js (render PDF pages to canvas)
  - jsPDF (build the compressed PDF)
- One shared CSS file and one shared JS file for common code, plus a small JS file per tool type (image tool, PDF tool, signature tool).
- The tool code must be reusable: each tool page only sets a config such as { type: "image", targetKB: 50 } and the shared script does the rest.
- Mobile-first, responsive, works down to 320px width.
- Fast: no heavy images, use inline SVG icons, system font stack, lazy-load anything below the fold. Target Lighthouse 90+ on mobile.
- Accessible: large tap targets (minimum 48px), good contrast, labels on all buttons, keyboard usable.

